<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-riedel-delta-notch-phase-synchrony> a pk:Claim ;
    rdfs:label "Riedel-Kruse et al. (2007) & Morelli et al. (2009) zebrafish Delta-Notch delayed Kuramoto phase synchrony, ALD failure, and PRP washout rescue (Danio rerio (zebrafish presomitic mesoderm & paraxial somites))",
        "Riedel-Kruse et al. (2007) & Morelli et al. (2009) zebrafish Delta-Notch delayed Kuramoto phase synchrony, ALD failure, and PRP washout rescue faithfully reproduces Danio rerio (zebrafish presomitic mesoderm & paraxial somites) morphology" ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/riedel-delta-notch-phase-synchrony-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/riedel-delta-notch-phase-synchrony-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/riedel-delta-notch-phase-synchrony-3> ;
    dct:description "The simulation script(s) 2006-riedel-delta-notch-phase-synchrony.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Danio rerio (zebrafish presomitic mesoderm & paraxial somites) specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is the weight of evidence (MorphoEval 0.1.0 overall 91.0/100, audit 2026-10-19-delta-notch-phase-synchrony-audit-v2) and the assessments." ;
    dct:subject <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/317bc3c/2006-riedel-delta-notch-phase-synchrony.py> ;
    schema:about "Danio rerio (zebrafish presomitic mesoderm & paraxial somites)" ;
    schema:additionalProperty "does_not_claim: Full 3D cell-sorting advection in the tailbud progenitor zone or explicit Mib1 E3 ubiquitin ligase endocytosis stoichiometry",
        "reconstructed_in_script: 2D 8x8 delayed Kuramoto PSM lattice with delay history buffer reproducing gastrula initiation (R_0 = 0.18 -> 0.986), DAPT Notch blockade failure (ALD = 5.5 somites), and DAPT washout rescue (PRP = 14.5 somites, R_min = 0.283 -> rescued R = 0.986)",
        "reconstructed_in_script: Bilateral dorsal somite row DoG peak and inter-somitic cleft segmentation on zebrafish_psm_synchrony_specimen.jpg (48.47 px mean spacing, symmetry ratio 0.9605)",
        "reconstructed_in_script: Transcendental collective frequency solver and 2D (tau_c, kappa) linear stability tongue mapping verifying attractive in-phase synchronization at tau_c = 20.5 min (T_sync = 22.18 min, kappa_eff = 0.0623 min^-1 > 0) vs repulsive anti-phase instability at tau_c = 11.0 min (kappa_eff = -0.0353 min^-1 < 0)",
        "reported_in_source: Collective synchronization frequency shift Omega = omega_0 - kappa*sin(Omega*tau_c), linear stability stiffness kappa_eff = kappa*cos(Omega*tau_c) > 0, and DAPT pulse-chase Anterior Limit of Defects (ALD ~ 5-7 somites) and Posterior Rescue Point (PRP after washout)",
        "reported_in_source: Riedel-Kruse et al. (2007) Science 317:1911-1915 & Morelli et al. (2009) HFSP J. 3:55-66 delayed Kuramoto phase-oscillator model dtheta_i/dt = omega_0 + (kappa/z)*sum_j sin(theta_j(t - tau_c) - theta_i(t)) + xi_i(t)",
        "transfer_boundary: 2D delayed Kuramoto PSM phase lattice and 1D clock-gated somite boundary profile mapped to dorsal vertebrate SEM somite metameres" ;
    pk:context "script(s): https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/317bc3c/2006-riedel-delta-notch-phase-synchrony.py; output: docs/media/delta_notch_phase_synchrony_comparison.png; organism: Danio rerio (zebrafish presomitic mesoderm & paraxial somites); checkpoint commit: https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/commit/317bc3c; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1; spec_fingerprint: 3839bc471581fe7db9e5667737685528fa65076d2960ae3e4a7d5372c54a4e07; artifact_sha256: 3375f3ba7e7ccb413d9e89b34eea5d67f6f5273d7fd87f1f853c21b3ae4af792; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/delta_notch_phase_synchrony/delta_notch_phase_synchrony_reference.json=cb19f0fbe10df59a..., datasets/delta_notch_phase_synchrony/scout_manifest.json=e3250a43b4bc0c22..., datasets/delta_notch_phase_synchrony/zebrafish_psm_synchrony_specimen.jpg=8b80971796cb29e2...}; supersedes_audit_id: 2026-10-19-delta-notch-phase-synchrony-audit; claim_boundary: [reported_in_source: Riedel-Kruse et al. (2007) Science 317:1911-1915 & Morelli et al. (2009) HFSP J. 3:55-66 delayed Kuramoto phase-oscillator model dtheta_i/dt = omega_0 + (kappa/z)*sum_j sin(theta_j(t - tau_c) - theta_i(t)) + xi_i(t) | Collective synchronization frequency shift Omega = omega_0 - kappa*sin(Omega*tau_c), linear stability stiffness kappa_eff = kappa*cos(Omega*tau_c) > 0, and DAPT pulse-chase Anterior Limit of Defects (ALD ~ 5-7 somites) and Posterior Rescue Point (PRP after washout); reconstructed_in_script: Transcendental collective frequency solver and 2D (tau_c, kappa) linear stability tongue mapping verifying attractive in-phase synchronization at tau_c = 20.5 min (T_sync = 22.18 min, kappa_eff = 0.0623 min^-1 > 0) vs repulsive anti-phase instability at tau_c = 11.0 min (kappa_eff = -0.0353 min^-1 < 0) | 2D 8x8 delayed Kuramoto PSM lattice with delay history buffer reproducing gastrula initiation (R_0 = 0.18 -> 0.986), DAPT Notch blockade failure (ALD = 5.5 somites), and DAPT washout rescue (PRP = 14.5 somites, R_min = 0.283 -> rescued R = 0.986) | Bilateral dorsal somite row DoG peak and inter-somitic cleft segmentation on zebrafish_psm_synchrony_specimen.jpg (48.47 px mean spacing, symmetry ratio 0.9605); transfer_boundary: 2D delayed Kuramoto PSM phase lattice and 1D clock-gated somite boundary profile mapped to dorsal vertebrate SEM somite metameres; does_not_claim: Full 3D cell-sorting advection in the tailbud progenitor zone or explicit Mib1 E3 ubiquitin ligase endocytosis stoichiometry]" ;
    pk:derivedFromPaper <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cub.2010.06.034>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/nature04861>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1126/science.1142538>,
