    pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-riedel-delta-notch-phase-synchrony-code-traceability>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-riedel-delta-notch-phase-synchrony-model-fidelity>,
