<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-riedel-delta-notch-phase-synchrony-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Riedel-Kruse et al. (2007) & Morelli et al. (2009) zebrafish Delta-Notch delayed Kuramoto phase synchrony, ALD failure, and PRP washout rescue — Morphometric validation: 92/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Extracts 5 reference-anchored quantitative morphometric measurements via `measure_morphoeval()` (L450-535): collective synchronization period T_sync = 22.18 min vs 22.18 min (shifting to T_0 = 25.00 min under DAPT), effective linear stability stiffness kappa_eff = 0.0623 min^-1 at tau_c = 20.5 min vs -0.0353 min^-1 in the repulsive anti-phase window tau_c = 11.0 min, DAPT pulse-chase Anterior Limit of Defects ALD = 5.5 somites vs 5.5 (with Posterior Rescue Point PRP = 14.5 somites and Kuramoto R recovering from 0.283 to 0.986), 5-regime ALD Pearson correlation r = 0.9999 (p = 1.62e-7, RMSE = 0.077 somites), and bilateral SEM specimen somite spacing 48.47 +/- 9.69 px (CV = 0.1999, symmetry ratio = 0.9605)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-riedel-delta-notch-phase-synchrony-measurement-dapt-pulse-chase-anterior-limit-of-defects-ald-and-posterior-rescue-point-prp-lag>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-riedel-delta-notch-phase-synchrony-measurement-delayed-kuramoto-collective-synchronization-period-t-sync-vs-autonomous-t-0>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-riedel-delta-notch-phase-synchrony-measurement-effective-in-phase-linear-stability-stiffness-kappa-eff-kappa-cos-omega-tau-c>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-riedel-delta-notch-phase-synchrony-measurement-riedel-kruse-2007-5-regime-dapt-ald-prediction-pearson-correlation-r>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-riedel-delta-notch-phase-synchrony-measurement-vertebrate-embryo-sem-specimen-bilateral-somite-spacing-s-obs>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-riedel-delta-notch-phase-synchrony-morphometric-validation-1> ;
    pk:hasScore 9.2e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-riedel-delta-notch-phase-synchrony-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Riedel-Kruse et al. (2007) & Morelli et al. (2009) zebrafish Delta-Notch delayed Kuramoto phase synchrony, ALD failure, and PRP washout rescue — MorphoEval overall 91.0/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 2 post-remediation evaluation of `2006-riedel-delta-notch-phase-synchrony.py` (91.3/100, up from 59.3/100 in Pass 1; +32.0 overall). The remediated script solves the transcendental delayed Kuramoto collective frequency equation Omega = omega_0 - kappa*sin(Omega*tau_c) (T_sync = 22.18 min vs uncoupled T_0 = 25.00 min), verifies Morelli et al.'s (2009) linear stability stiffness criterion kappa_eff = kappa*cos(Omega*tau_c) across attractive in-phase (tau_c = 20.5 min, kappa_eff = 0.0623 min^-1 > 0) and repulsive anti-phase (tau_c = 11.0 min, kappa_eff = -0.0353 min^-1 < 0) delay regimes, integrates a 2D 8x8 delayed Kuramoto PSM lattice across gastrula initiation, continuous DAPT Notch blockade (ALD = s_in + 5.5 somites), and DAPT pulse-washout rescue (s_in = 0, s_out = 9 -> ALD = 5.5, PRP = 14.5 somites; 5-regime Pearson r = 0.9999, RMSE = 0.077 somites), and segments the vendored vertebrate SEM specimen (`zebrafish_psm_synchrony_specimen.jpg`, 8 upper and 9 lower somites, mean spacing 48.47 px), backed by 3 machine-checked Lean 4 theorems in `Loop_023_delta_notch_phase_synchrony.lean`. Overall 91.0/100 (faithfulness 90.6, reproducibility 91.7); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 317bc3c; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 94, Morphological realism / specimen match 87, Parameter expressivity 91, Morphometric validation 92, Source and data traceability 93, Code-to-model traceability 91, Reproducibility package 91. Output judged: docs/media/delta_notch_phase_synchrony_comparison.png: rendered output of 2006-riedel-delta-notch-phase-synchrony.py at 317bc3c, image/png, 1227882 B, 2352×1372 px, artifact_sha256 3375f3ba7e7ccb413d9e89b34eea5d67f6f5273d7fd87f1f853c21b3ae4af792 (sha256 3375f3ba7e7ccb413d9e89b34eea5d67f6f5273d7fd87f1f853c21b3ae4af792), spec_fingerprint 3839bc471581fe7db9e5667737685528fa65076d2960ae3e4a7d5372c54a4e07. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 3839bc471581fe7db9e5667737685528fa65076d2960ae3e4a7d5372c54a4e07; artifact_sha256: 3375f3ba7e7ccb413d9e89b34eea5d67f6f5273d7fd87f1f853c21b3ae4af792; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/delta_notch_phase_synchrony/delta_notch_phase_synchrony_reference.json=cb19f0fbe10df59a..., datasets/delta_notch_phase_synchrony/scout_manifest.json=e3250a43b4bc0c22..., datasets/delta_notch_phase_synchrony/zebrafish_psm_synchrony_specimen.jpg=8b80971796cb29e2...}. Supersedes audit: 2026-10-19-delta-notch-phase-synchrony-audit. Claim boundary: reported_in_source: Riedel-Kruse et al. (2007) Science 317:1911-1915 & Morelli et al. (2009) HFSP J. 3:55-66 delayed Kuramoto phase-oscillator model dtheta_i/dt = omega_0 + (kappa/z)*sum_j sin(theta_j(t - tau_c) - theta_i(t)) + xi_i(t) | Collective synchronization frequency shift Omega = omega_0 - kappa*sin(Omega*tau_c), linear stability stiffness kappa_eff = kappa*cos(Omega*tau_c) > 0, and DAPT pulse-chase Anterior Limit of Defects (ALD ~ 5-7 somites) and Posterior Rescue Point (PRP after washout); reconstructed_in_script: Transcendental collective frequency solver and 2D (tau_c, kappa) linear stability tongue mapping verifying attractive in-phase synchronization at tau_c = 20.5 min (T_sync = 22.18 min, kappa_eff = 0.0623 min^-1 > 0) vs repulsive anti-phase instability at tau_c = 11.0 min (kappa_eff = -0.0353 min^-1 < 0) | 2D 8x8 delayed Kuramoto PSM lattice with delay history buffer reproducing gastrula initiation (R_0 = 0.18 -> 0.986), DAPT Notch blockade failure (ALD = 5.5 somites), and DAPT washout rescue (PRP = 14.5 somites, R_min = 0.283 -> rescued R = 0.986) | Bilateral dorsal somite row DoG peak and inter-somitic cleft segmentation on zebrafish_psm_synchrony_specimen.jpg (48.47 px mean spacing, symmetry ratio 0.9605); transfer_boundary: 2D delayed Kuramoto PSM phase lattice and 1D clock-gated somite boundary profile mapped to dorsal vertebrate SEM somite metameres; does_not_claim: Full 3D cell-sorting advection in the tailbud progenitor zone or explicit Mib1 E3 ubiquitin ligase endocytosis stoichiometry." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Couple the 2D delayed Kuramoto lattice to a spatially advecting 1D/2D FGF8/Wnt frequency gradient to model traveling kinematic phase waves alongside DAPT washout.",
        "remediation needed: Incorporate explicit intracellular Mindbomb (Mib1) DeltaC ubiquitination kinetics into the coupling strength kappa(t)." ;
    pk:hasScore 9.1e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-riedel-delta-notch-phase-synchrony-parameter-expressivity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Riedel-Kruse et al. (2007) & Morelli et al. (2009) zebrafish Delta-Notch delayed Kuramoto phase synchrony, ALD failure, and PRP washout rescue — Parameter expressivity: 91/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Evaluates all 5 experimental DAPT regimes from Riedel-Kruse et al. (2007) (WT DMSO control, s_in = 0 gastrula DAPT, s_in = 4 DAPT, s_in = 9 DAPT, and s_in = 0 / s_out = 9 pulse-washout rescue), maps the 2D (tau_c, kappa) linear stability tongue morphospace across tau_c in [0.5, 32] min and kappa in [0.01, 0.14] min^-1 (Panel B), scans stable vs unstable collective period branches T_sync(tau_c) (Panel C), and exposes CLI flags (`--kappa`, `--tau-c`, `--s-in`, `--s-out`, `--seed`)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-parameter-expressivity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
